":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- And possibly taking more time out of classes for them to receive those therapies. So this is again with Northwestern University and coming out of those carryover funds with the smart grant And is this one where the contract will come later as well I am","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3317-130","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3317,"timestampLabel":"55:17","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- I believe that this agreement has all of the terms and there was an amendment. Amendment isn't the correct term. There was an appendix to it that had all of the","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3330-131","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3330,"timestampLabel":"55:30","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- work agreements in it. So this one was a little bit different because it did have all of the particulars in it, whereas the first one did not. So I'll be bringing the contract back to you on the first one, but this one did have the particulars in it. So this has everything we need to approve it in one fell swoop tonight. Okay. And its value? Say that one more time. The total value? Total value of this one is...","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-334-14","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":334,"timestampLabel":"5:34","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- The process of identifying the needs and we did that by first of all, we had a facility study done in 2022 and we continue to operate off of that facility studies study that we've identified the needs that","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3358-132","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3358,"timestampLabel":"55:58","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- $64,750. That's correct. Thank you, Christine. Awesome. Thank you. Has it already been moved in a second? Yes. OK. It was all fast. OK. Any further discussion? All those in favor say aye. Aye. Opposed? Motion carries. And now we'll look at revisions to the roles and responsibilities of the corporation administrative staff. Dr. Sanders.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3388-133","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3388,"timestampLabel":"56:28","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Yes, so sometimes the change is really hard. And we have a team approach here at Edgewood. And when you lose an all-star part of your team, it's really devastating at first because","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3418-134","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3418,"timestampLabel":"56:58","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- I really appreciated Matt Irwin and what he brought to our team. He was a good, great partner. And when that change happens at first, you're just really upset about it. But then you start to think about, well, how can we take this opportunity to make ourselves better?","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3443-135","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3443,"timestampLabel":"57:23","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- And when I started thinking about the different scenarios of how we might respond to Matt's departure, we really came up across the realization that here at Edgewood, we're deep and rich in talent.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3470-136","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3470,"timestampLabel":"57:50","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- And so it really didn't take a lot of consideration to realize that we had people right here already on our team who could step up. And in the sports analogy, it's always a next man up. And what that means is that the most successful teams","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3498-137","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3498,"timestampLabel":"58:18","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- They may have their maybe their starting lineup, but they're a great team because they have a great bench who could step right into a starting role. And that was the idea is that we I wanted to continue","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3517-138","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3517,"timestampLabel":"58:37","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- on without missing a beat for the school corporation. We've made a lot of progress over the last several years, and we want to continue to march forward and keep that momentum going, not only for our students, but our staff also. And so being very transparent, what I did is I asked Matt to make a list of all the things that he does.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-354-15","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":354,"timestampLabel":"5:54","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- are prioritized in that study. We've had two demographic studies, the most recent one by McKibbin demographics in 2024. And then most recently, the board has met with teachers, administrators, athletic director, representatives from the performing arts, maintenance departments, skill and construction,","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3543-139","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3543,"timestampLabel":"59:03","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- or has done here in the school corporation. And I took every item on that list and assigned it to somebody in this office. I'm taking on more responsibilities. I'll have more direct responsibility for operations, transportation, food service, technology, maintenance,","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3574-140","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3574,"timestampLabel":"59:34","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- some of the things that Matt took care of there. Jennifer Barrett here is going to become our assistant superintendent. She's going to keep doing most of what she's been doing in terms of our focus on instruction and curriculum, but she needed to take on some other responsibilities. We have","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3600-141","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https