tMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3856-151","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3856,"timestampLabel":"1:04:16","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- to make sure our finances continue in the right direction. And we're gonna use this year to evaluate the roles and responsibility each person has and make some adjustments accordingly. And a year from now, Debbie's gonna be ready to fly on her own, but even then we'll provide support for her","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3882-152","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3882,"timestampLabel":"1:04:42","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- through networking, through Stiefel, and provided her with a team that could back her. And I will tell you already, I feel really good about this. As I mentioned when I first started, change is hard. You don't always want change, but I could tell already, today I had a conversation with Susan Shockney on several different","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3911-153","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3911,"timestampLabel":"1:05:11","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- positions, and we were talking about the rates that we should apply to each person. And she came to me, like we should in this office, she came to me with solid information, facts. She gave me options, and she gave me recommendations. We had a conversation. In the end, we made the best possible decision, and that's what excites me. I feel really good about our future moving forward.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3941-154","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3941,"timestampLabel":"1:05:41","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- you're improving the career of our folks that are here. Because I think if you get stagnant, sometimes that's how you lose valuable people. And so I'm very excited about this. And I think they're only going to continue to make us stronger. So I'm very happy with how it has gone. Ditto to all that.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-3971-155","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":3971,"timestampLabel":"1:06:11","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Dr. Sanders, Ms. Barrett, for pulling us all together. One thing I do want to challenge all the administrators and the contract change peoples for these positions are funded by grants. And we have to continue to seek new grants to continue some of these things that are moving forward. So Mr. Dixon, good luck on that. No pressure, Ms. Barrett. And I do want to mention on the RDC grant, it funds two positions. I've been sitting on that committee for the last","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4001-156","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4001,"timestampLabel":"1:06:41","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- whatever day in three or four years, and that's, they're meeting again tomorrow, and they're talking about shortfalls at the RDC, and that makes me nervous. But we always have, it's just, we gotta deal with it as it's thrown at us, so. But yeah, I think this is gonna work out great, and kudos to everybody stepping up to the plate. Absolutely. Any further discussion?","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4029-157","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4029,"timestampLabel":"1:07:09","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- I do appreciate all the conversations and I think this was well thought out and definitely was a strategically planned transition and so I appreciate that. All those in favor say aye. Aye. Opposed? Motion carries. Now consideration to approve the contracts for the 15 bulleted individuals under number 22.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4058-158","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4058,"timestampLabel":"1:07:38","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Let me explain this a little bit too in terms of when you're adding additional responsibilities, not just the number of responsibilities and duties, but the significance of what they're doing, a lot more pressure that's gonna be on somebody. So we wanted to fairly compensate each of these individuals who are taking on additional roles. And once again, this is where the team here came together","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4085-159","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4085,"timestampLabel":"1:08:05","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- and we were in the conference room and they had a spreadsheet up on the screen and Susan and Debbie were entering data into that spreadsheet and providing me with information that I could simply look at it and say, okay, that makes sense, we need to adjust that dollar figure and","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4113-160","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4113,"timestampLabel":"1:08:33","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- kind of repeating what I've seen earlier, it's a team that's already started to work well together. And the other thing that I wanted to try to do, take this opportunity in, was last year we took a number of our employees because we thought there 