think we've accomplished a lot over the years and We're gonna make a great team. That's that's so important for this superintendent","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-419-18","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":419,"timestampLabel":"6:59","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- I have a tag team on this one. This is the same presentation that we had at the first preliminary determination meeting. You can see on this first slide is the current situation with our outstanding debt. And if we did nothing, that this would be the years that the debt would be coming off in different bonds. The next slide is if we","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4193-163","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4193,"timestampLabel":"1:09:53","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- to be able to have a strong team supporting him or her. And Jennifer is definitely a great partner. And so she'll be the assistant superintendent of teaching and learning with a salary of 109,000 and that'll be paid out of operations. Debbie Tate will be the director of budget and finance and her new salary will be $71,000 and she will also be paid out of operations.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4222-164","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4222,"timestampLabel":"1:10:22","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Susan Shockney will be the director of personnel. Her new salary would be 64,600 paid out of operations. Jenny Johnson, she will be the manager of student services and business operations. That'll be her title for a salary of $63,120. And her salary split 50% out of operations and 50% out of education.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4252-165","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4252,"timestampLabel":"1:10:52","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Robin May has the same title, basically executive secretary and deputy treasurer, but she has also taken on additional roles and responsibilities for a salary of $60,619 paid for out of operation.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4272-166","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4272,"timestampLabel":"1:11:12","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- John Keefer is our payroll specialist. His salary will remain the same at $53,601.60, and mainly that's because we wanted, you know, payroll is so important, and I really did not want to add something to John's duties, and suddenly he's overburdened, and we have a mistake made in payroll.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4301-167","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4301,"timestampLabel":"1:11:41","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- And so he's going to have the same duties. Now, as we make adjustments down the road, we might add something to him if it makes sense and doesn't overburden him. And I'd like to introduce Noah Dixon. Noah has been a special education teacher at Edgewood Junior High School, and he has his,","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4327-168","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4327,"timestampLabel":"1:12:07","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Director of Special Education License, and Noah blew us away in his interview. And it's one of those interviews, if you sat in on an interview and while you're sitting there, you're thinking, oh my goodness, this is our person. And it's kind of the same feeling I had several years ago when we interviewed Jennifer Anderson the first time.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4354-169","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4354,"timestampLabel":"1:12:34","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- When we were interviewing her, I had the same thought. She's the person I wanted, and that's how I feel about Noah. He's gonna be a great addition to this team. His new salary will be $82,000, and it's paid for out of the Part B SPED grant. I know I'm taking a long time here, but one of the things that we were trying to do with this Jennifer Anderson's departure was I wanted to take some","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4384-170","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4384,"timestampLabel":"1:13:04","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- some duties off of that that position. And the idea originally was to focus that position just be focused on special education and mental health. But it was very clear that really everybody we interviewed was either very strong in one area or the other. And with this","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4410-171","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4410,"timestampLabel":"1:13:30","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- I see change as opportunities. So with this opportunity, I wanted to have Noah be specifically focused on special education and supporting his team and meeting the needs of our special education students.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4431-172","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4431,"timestampLabel":"1:13:51","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Noah is just going to be over special education, just. He's going to be over special education. But he won't have to worry about also being over mental health. And so what we did there is Jordan Truax was already at that position. But we're going to have asked Jordan to take on some more administrative support in terms of providing support for administrators with","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4460-173","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4460,"timestampLabel":"1:14:20","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- behavior issues throughout the school at the elementary level. We have a plan, but we're still working on that plan for a six to 12 mental health coordinator. And we wanted to have some more discussion on that before we brought that to the board. So you could look forward to that here in the near future.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4487-174","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4487,"timestampLabel":"1:14:47","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Jordan's salary will be $70,000. It's paid for out of the SMART grant. Megan Scott and Mariah Bruce, they're taking on some of the duties and responsibilities that Jennifer had that we had to take off her plate so she could take some of Matt's duties on. And so Megan's new salary will be $79,837. Mariah Bruce will be $76,000.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-449-19","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":449,"timestampLabel":"7:29","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- get approval for the projects, the asking permission to bond for the $40 million. This is how it would show in terms of current debt and potential debt over the next several years.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4517-175","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4517,"timestampLabel":"1:15:17","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- $675 and that'll be paid for out of the RDC grant. The rest here are from our technology department and they were switched from hourly, from salary to hourly, and we're going to move them back to salary. So their salaries didn't change any, but they will be on a salary and that'll,","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4544-176","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4544,"timestampLabel":"1:15:44","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- bringing a lot of benefits both to them and the school corporation. And then one of my concerns with Matt's departure is it's very important for us to have plenty of eyes on our construction projects. And one of the worries I had was even though Arnold Caldwell does a good job as superintendent, I'm all often called away for this or that.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4573-177","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4573,"timestampLabel":"1:16:13","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- And I might miss a punch list meeting. I might miss something very important on the construction sites. So I asked Rick Routen to take on some additional duties in terms of supporting construction projects. And so he's already come in handy where he's joined me as we've walked through the different construction projects.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4603-178","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4603,"timestampLabel":"1:16:43","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- He's I think it's next week he's going. We have a schedule for a punch list in one of our schools and I already have a previous engagement. So Rick's going to be there for me and Rick brings a lot of experience to the to the table in that and he's very detail oriented and. Well, the","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4630-179","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4630,"timestampLabel":"1:17:10","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- The first time I asked him to go represent me at a meeting, at the end of the night, I got this very detailed report. And I thought, yep, that was the right decision. So that'll be a $2,000 stipend for Rick. And that'll be for this year, and we'll see what happens down the road with other projects.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4659-180","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4659,"timestampLabel":"1:17:39","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- like, you know, we're taking on a lot of extra salaries and I want to make sure to note in our operations fund we're actually looking at a net change of almost negative $9,000. In the RDC grant, a net change of negative $41,000. In our SPED grant, a net change right now of negative $27,000.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4685-181","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4685,"timestampLabel":"1:18:05","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- And in our education fund, we would be increasing that by about $1,200. So I do want to make sure and note that, because when we're talking about increases in salary, it makes it sound like we are definitely adding that money on. And I don't want that perception to be out there that we are tipping the scale on administrative salaries here. And in fact, what we're doing is saving the district quite a bit of money, thousands of money, thousands of dollars here,","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4714-182","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4714,"timestampLabel":"1:18:34","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- because we have been very intentional about making sure that we're replacing positions where we need to, but we're also absorbing roles and responsibilities where we can, and stretching ourselves here a little bit to make sure that we're being fiscally responsible in these decisions. So I just want to make sure and note that in all of those funds. I appreciate that, Jennifer, and actually we're saving even more than what Jennifer noted there because","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-473-20","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":473,"timestampLabel":"7:53","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- And then the last slide here really just shows some of the specific projections in terms of numbers, interest rate, payment, estimated payments, and how this project would impact the finances for Edgewood schools. Do you wanna add anything? Slide two, if you can go back to slide two.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4743-183","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4743,"timestampLabel":"1:19:03","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- We were going to we were already trying to figure out how to take some money off of the RDC grant and we're gonna have to Jennifer's salary a lot of that was paid for from the RDC grant and we were trying to Work on a better budget so that we would have some funds to be able to do some other things not just with personnel and so","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4774-184","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4774,"timestampLabel":"1:19:34","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- We already had plans of taking her salary and put it into education. And so this takes care of that also. We have a motion. Excuse me, I'll move approval. I second. OK. Any questions, discussion? I just note that Dr. Barrett's addition there at the end is exactly what we need from that end of the table. So thank you. I appreciate that.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4804-185","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4804,"timestampLabel":"1:20:04","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Thank you, yes. Okay, anything further? All those in favor say aye. Aye. Opposed? Motion carries. And now we turn to the superintendent's report, Dr. Standard. I haven't spoken enough tonight. I'll make this quick. I know I already shared with the board that our 1003 flexibility waiver was approved by the state.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4834-186","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4834,"timestampLabel":"1:20:34","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- But what I wanted to add to that is that we were approved for three years. So we're good with the flexibility waiver through the 2027, 2028 school year. And so I thought that was really good news for the school corporation. We've talked many times about the biomedical training program.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4857-187","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4857,"timestampLabel":"1:20:57","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- I think we've shared with you how we've made progress with Boston Scientific in terms of getting precise with how we're going to transform their training modules into the high school setting. We had a great meeting and visit at Cook Medical yesterday and they were enthusiastically on board","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4887-188","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4887,"timestampLabel":"1:21:27","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- with continuing to work with us. They talked about their mission. They talked about their training modules. And these trainers are full of passion. And while they were talking to us, all I could think about is, man, these","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4903-189","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4903,"timestampLabel":"1:21:43","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- These people are going to be great in front of high school students. They're going to really connect with them. They're going to inspire them. They're going to make the connections necessary. And so we've got some momentum going with Cook now.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4918-190","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4918,"timestampLabel":"1:21:58","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- And we are setting up a regular meetings so we could take what they do there and transform it to what we can do at Edgewood High School. And also I'm going to be, we know we've talked about the construction and adding on the biomedical training rooms to the high school. And so I'm going to get their input on the architect","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4945-191","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4945,"timestampLabel":"1:22:25","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- plans that we have. So they could say, yeah, that works. That's the right size. You don't need that much space and that type of thing. So very excited about that progress. And the rest of this is just really for the board and the public to know that, I hate to, some people may not like this news, but the 2025-26 school year is just around the corner.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4972-192","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4972,"timestampLabel":"1:22:52","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- And I'm going to be getting out the letter to our staff on the 17th, to students and parents on the 18th. Our school calendar is already on the website. We'll be including that information in the email to parents. And once again, we'll be giving every student and staff member magnetic calendars to put on the refrigerators.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-4998-193","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":4998,"timestampLabel":"1:23:18","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- So everybody will know what's coming up during the school year. Our principals and secretaries that are not year round will report on July 21st. And we'll be getting out information to our parents on school supply giveaways that we will have.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-502-21","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":502,"timestampLabel":"8:22","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Those are, I guess I would just say it's based on, that's max parameters, and that is assuming that you guys were to issue everything at the max parameter. I think Jerry will work with Stiefel, and based on your needs, you'll probably do multiple series. We've authorized multiple series over the next couple of years. And this also makes some assumptions about the impact of Senate Bill 1.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5020-194","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5020,"timestampLabel":"1:23:40","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Of course, we have our own RBB student assistance fund that we use to provide school supplies. There are other organizations such as Tri Kappa that provides donations to the school corporation. And then Ellisville Christian Church will have their annual back to school bash on July 26th.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5043-195","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5043,"timestampLabel":"1:24:03","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- from 10 a.m. until noon, it's a fun day to come out and enjoy some activities and also get a backpack and some free school supplies. I just want everybody to know that there is not one Edgewood student that would go without school supplies. And so if somebody, if there's a family out there that's really worried about spending that money, you don't have to worry about that, we'll take care of you.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5073-196","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5073,"timestampLabel":"1:24:33","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- School offices will open to the public on July 23rd. Registration window is going to open July 23rd. Back to school meeting for nutrition services staff will be August 4th. The bus drivers will have a meeting on July 31st. We'll have a back to school breakfast and meeting for our staff and teachers the morning of August 4th. August 5th, the teachers","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5100-197","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5100,"timestampLabel":"1:25:00","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- teachers will have a work day in their classrooms to get ready for school. And then the first day of school will be August 6th. It usually starts about seven. And the new teaching orientation, what time will they show up here? What time you have that going, Jennifer, the new teachers orientation? On the 29th, it'll be just","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5129-198","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5129,"timestampLabel":"1:25:29","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- brand new teachers, and on the 30th it'll be brand new teachers and teachers who have experience but they might be new to Edgewood. We're working on that plan right now. Megan Scott's taking the lead on new teacher orientation and mentor teachers. I just saw the proposed agenda for that today.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5148-199","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5148,"timestampLabel":"1:25:48","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- We're looking at starting that around 10 o'clock or so on July 29th, keeping those brand new and one year teachers till about three o'clock that day. We have a full agenda for them just to introduce them to Edgewood, answer just basic questions. You know, first year teachers coming right out, no experience may have. And then the 30th will be a half day session where we'll have all of our teachers new to Edgewood joining those","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5176-200","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5176,"timestampLabel":"1:26:16","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- those first year teachers from the first day. Do you mind if we take a session on that Mr. DeMoss? I'll get you on the agenda. Well thank you very much and now we'll turn to RBBEA comments and we have Brandy Able with us here this evening.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5204-201","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5204,"timestampLabel":"1:26:44","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- three weeks, my daughter Paige, I know many of you remember her, has been texting me this whole time and for some reason she has my location on her phone and her last message was, you're starting with meetings already. So here we are.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5220-202","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5220,"timestampLabel":"1:27:00","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- I want to start by saying we do have another co-president. Hopefully you'll be meeting him soon. Stepped up at the 11th hour. Ty McGinnis, he'll be coming from the high school. And so I know that was Doug's hope to have somebody represent secondary and I'll be representing elementary. We met with Nancy a few weeks ago, had lunch with her, and since we're both newbies, it'll be nice. We're already making plans and hopefully can delegate more and just change","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5250-203","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5250,"timestampLabel":"1:27:30","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- change how the leadership has been since we're both brand new. And speaking of, I was going to say next week I would be reaching out but, Jennifer, I'll be reaching out maybe tomorrow to you and Megan because I know we always have that lunch for the new teachers so I'll get those numbers from you so I can start organizing that and know when to do that.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-527-22","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":527,"timestampLabel":"8:47","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- But I think the point is, working with Stiefel, Jerry, your goal is to make this kind of tax neutral for the taxpayers. What's that? That's at the 7%. That's at the max. I think that assumes a drop in net assessed value, and it assumes very conservative growth, if any at all. So yeah, they're trying to set you up to","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5273-204","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5273,"timestampLabel":"1:27:53","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- I just want to say, again, I appreciate Matt Irwin for everything he's done. And I was able to thank him personally for his service. And just again, he and Dr. Sanders, I've enjoyed working with both of you for the past couple of years with Association Matters. We've had hard conversations. And I just appreciate the communication and all the information and seeing through your eyes things that I don't see on my end. So anyway, just.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5303-205","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5303,"timestampLabel":"1:28:23","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- continued I look forward to continuing to work with you and bargaining and all that so that's all I have to say yeah thank you thank you now for board members we'll start with mr. boss tell page that your meetings are just starting and you will have more of them I am just so excited it there is such a","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5331-206","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5331,"timestampLabel":"1:28:51","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- a positive feel about where things are going. And I'm excited about the beginning of a new school year. It's hard to believe three weeks from tomorrow, kids will be in the classrooms, teachers will be ready to take them away. And I'm looking forward to it. I feel the same way. Thank you, sir. I'm so pleased and so happy for Jennifer and her crew that she'll be","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5356-207","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5356,"timestampLabel":"1:29:16","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- So we appreciate your your loyalty so much. We appreciate it. Thank you. I'm very excited about the new changes of contract in our administration team. You know it is nerve wracking is nerve wracking as a board when you have somebody step away and the capacity that Matt was in. However. I feel complete calm as as myself as a","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5386-208","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5386,"timestampLabel":"1:29:46","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- as a board member, I feel that this corporation is going to be in great hands. We have nothing to worry about. I know that everyone is going to be working very hard. You know, the next few years for us is going to be difficult. But with this team, I believe in all of us and that we're going to get through it. And it's going to continue to be a great school system. Mr. Director. Yeah, Ditto. I feel very much at comfort. I think we're in good shape.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5416-209","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5416,"timestampLabel":"1:30:16","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Thanks for helping us out again, Paul, for a little while. And yeah, looking forward to the school year. Three more weeks. Thank you. Yes, it comes fast. It's amazing how fast the summer goes. And it's hard to believe that we're in for another year. But it's exciting. I feel calm and confident that we're going to have a great year this year. And I always want to make sure all you out there","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14775-tx-5446-210","meetingDate":"2025-07-15","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 7/15/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14775","timestampSeconds":5446,"timestampLabel":"1:30:46","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- very careful with the buses and things. It's always kind of rough the first couple of weeks or at least a few days. So please be patient and we would appreciate that and safety is number one. So I appreciate everyone coming tonight. I'm so glad that we're in the position we are and we've got the team we do. I think it's a successful team.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{