uired. And at this time, I will ask that Colin Cochran from Bowes, McKinney & Evans explain the purpose of this hearing. Good evening, members of the board. Colin Cochran with Bowes, McKinney & Evans. I am filling in for my colleague, Jake McClellan.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14701-tx-0-0","meetingDate":"2025-06-17","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 6/17/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","timestampSeconds":0,"timestampLabel":"0:00","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Next meeting to order, please stand for the Pledge of Allegiance. I pledge allegiance to the flag of the United States of America, and to the republic for which it stands, one nation under God, indivisible, with liberty and justice for all. Thank you all. Please be seated. And welcome to the June 2025 school board meeting, just a couple of weeks away from having a half of a year going already.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14701-tx-1021-37","meetingDate":"2025-06-17","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 6/17/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","timestampSeconds":1021,"timestampLabel":"17:01","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- We've got the exterior pretty well done. You can see the green metal panels. My sense is probably a lot of you have seen that in person. But rather than go through all the little items on last 60 and next 60, if it's all right with you all, I'd kinda like to just talk about what we're really driving on. The thing we need to get, and as we go through it, you'll see some pictures of the kitchen. We're really pushing on the kitchen.","