xt":"- Then we have personnel, resignations, retirements, non-renewals, leaves and terminations. That is C, one through 35. And D, personnel appointments and transfers, one through 57. And then we have out-of-state and overnight field trips, E, one through seven. And these are all of the normal high school and junior high","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14701-tx-1106-40","meetingDate":"2025-06-17","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 6/17/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","timestampSeconds":1106,"timestampLabel":"18:26","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- no later than July 21st to have that where it can be stocked and start using it. And again, if we do that the first week of July, that would give us three weeks to make that happen. We're hitting flooring real hard next week. And we ought to have a lot of the administration in those type of areas. Ceiling pads, we're dropping in ceiling pads.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14701-tx-1136-41","meetingDate":"2025-06-17","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 6/17/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","timestampSeconds":1136,"timestampLabel":"18:56","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Right now, jump to the administration and the clinic. I believe we've got map furniture coming on July 15th, if I'm correct on that. Yeah, furniture delivery install, yeah. So what our goal is to have the administration and clinic set up by July 21st, and I'm getting way off our PowerPoint here. But if we have that by July 21st,","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14701-tx-1166-42","meetingDate":"2025-06-17","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 6/17/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","timestampSeconds":1166,"timestampLabel":"19:26","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- set up, then Heather and her staff can get in there and get themselves going. And again, as I think everybody's aware, we're really pushing the early childhood. We've condensed it to a pretty short window and I think we're gonna make it. Teachers, we're saying they're gonna be in there on the 28th and we'll be able to set up their classrooms. That only really gives them one week","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14701-tx-1197-43","meetingDate":"2025-06-17","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 6/17/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","timestampSeconds":1197,"timestampLabel":"19:57","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- but we need to get it done and get cleaned before they move in. Paving will be done yet this month, but a lot of the landscape, and we're putting sod in up next to the building. So from the parking lot, it's gonna look done, because we'll have sod up there. But the fall planting season doesn't really start","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14701-tx-1225-44","meetingDate":"2025-06-17","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 6/17/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","timestampSeconds":1225,"timestampLabel":"20:25","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- until I think it's August 15th. So any turf out in the swale or around the north side of the building where it's seeded, that'll get seeded probably that first couple, or second couple weeks of August. And you're really not gonna see the turf coming up until September, October. What else have we got? Okay. And then the other thing that's,","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14701-tx-1255-45","meetingDate":"2025-06-17","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 6/17/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","timestampSeconds":1255,"timestampLabel":"20:55","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- that we're pushing is the playground. What we want to do is get all the paving and all that kind of stuff done so they can get around the north side of the building. And again, I'm way off of the program here. But the playground should be installed early July. They're waiting for a couple of events for that. And then they'll move into that.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14701-tx-1284-46","meetingDate":"2025-06-17","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 6/17/2025","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=14701","timestampSeconds":1284,"timestampLabel":"21:24","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Again, not to spend a lot of time on this piece, but I don't know if you want to look at some of the pretty pictures we have, if we could do that. And I guess with that, are there any questions on the early childhood? At this point, we feel pretty good about it. We're at the point where","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-14701-tx-1311-4